From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 12:13:09 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Admin: investment search, GHL ID in client modal, client +
 KYC CSV exports
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

- Investments: search by name / GHL ID / email / phone works (joined
  client fields copied onto the row the table searches)
- Client profile modal: GHL ID under the name instead of the row UUID
- All Clients export: GHL ID, name, email, phone, PAN, KYC, account, AUM,
  risk, RM, joined (AdminDataTable gains exportColumns / exportFileName;
  generic export now escapes quotes and skips the unlabeled actions column)
- KYC (Queue / Approved / Rejected): Export button — one row per client
  with each step's status, PAN, Aadhaar, bank, account, IFSC; GHL ID on
  the cards and searchable

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01BZzZ8gJpzApztfvJjGonBd
